{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297500","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297500","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029750001:1":{"text":"오는 길에 치피 님이 대략적인 상황을 이야기해 주었습니다.","source_cn":"来的路上，我已经听满满说过来龙去脉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3F8ED2D4199B49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029750002:1":{"text":"하지만 제가 잘 해낼 수 있을지 모르겠습니다. 그간 계속 혼자 숲에서만 지내서...","source_cn":"我不太确定能否胜任，毕竟此前我一直在丛林间离群索居……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x403879D733CE0C20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029750003:1":{"text":"아니에요, 팔라모르! 당신이 딱이에요!","source_cn":"不会呀，法拉莫尔，你是最合适的人选！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF54EE494CA7E2625","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029750004:1":{"text":"이 근처 길도 잘 알고, 품격도 넘치고...","source_cn":"你又熟悉这里的道路，为人又风度翩翩——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x549AA8669BB44107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029750005:1":{"text":"전투력과 리더십도 아주 뛰어나잖아요!","source_cn":"而且战斗力和领导力都非常强！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6B5C6388FA8DC0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029750006:1":{"text":"과찬이십니다... 그럼, 계속 사양하는 것도 실례겠군요.","source_cn":"谬赞了……再继续推拒就显得太无礼了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x295A9B2322778C03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029750007:1":{"text":"제가 시더 마을에 필요하다면, 힘을 보태겠습니다.","source_cn":"既然是雪松镇的需要，那么我也会尽一份力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8CE5ED4AAD989F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029750008:1":{"text":"좋아요! 그럼 담당자도 준비됐네요. 이제 물건 준비만 하면 될 것 같아요!","source_cn":"太好了！这样一来，这里的人手也准备齐全了，接着就只剩下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76C40B6B5FCC6F2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029750009:1":{"text":"발리카와 캐롤라이나에게 손님 맞이 준비를 하라고 알려줘도 좋겠어요!","source_cn":"我们也可以去通知瓦丽卡和卡列琳娜他们，做好迎接客人的准备！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x517C233D0B0C3AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029750010:1":{"text":"음, 그러면 그레이브본들도 시더 마을에 자연스럽게 녹아들고, 사람들의 편견도 서서히 줄어들게 될 거예요.","source_cn":"嗯，这样既能帮助他们融入到雪松镇里，也能潜移默化地减少...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B7141DCABCE845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029750011:1":{"text":"하지만 발리카가 이고르를 잘 붙잡아 둬야할 텐데요. 또 돌아다니면서 말썽부리면 안 되니까요!","source_cn":"不过，可得让瓦丽卡把伊戈尔管好，不能让他到处胡闹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8921636E64DC35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029750012:0":{"text":"앞으로의 계획을 열띠게 논의하던 중, 나의 짐 속에서 화려한 빛이 번쩍였다...","source_cn":"在你们热烈地讨论接下来的发展时，你突然注意到，包裹里闪...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x55EF24D32BB3C050","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"앞으로의 계획을 열띠게 논의하던 중, 나의 짐 속에서 화려한 빛이 번쩍였다...","female":"앞으로의 계획을 열띠게 논의하던 중, 나의 짐 속에서 화려한 빛이 번쩍였다...","variant_male_record_index":"104367","variant_female_record_index":"104368","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029750013:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 보세요! 책갈피가 또 반짝였어요!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x18B894CF8F4AA22E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 보세요! 책갈피가 또 반짝였어요!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 보세요! 책갈피가 또 반짝였어요!","variant_male_record_index":"104369","variant_female_record_index":"104370","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029750014:1":{"text":"이번에도 더 밝아진 것 같아요... 이제야 원래 모습이 좀 보이기 시작하네요!","source_cn":"而且这次又多亮了一些……已经能看出一些原本的模样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA2ECD99A08B3E24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1029750014":{"text":"이번에도 더 밝아진 것 같아요... 이제야 원래 모습이 좀 보이기 시작하네요!","source_cn":"而且这次又多亮了一些……已经能看出一些原本的模样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA2ECD99A08B3E24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029750015:1":{"text":"맞아요. 처음 시더 마을에 온 게 어제 같은데, 벌써 시간이 꽤 많이 지났네요...","source_cn":"是啊，回想起来，刚到雪松镇时好像还是昨天，但现在看来已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD95F047BF46173C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029750016:1":{"text":"제전, 눈, 그레이브본, 공주님... 그 모든 순간들이 즐거움과 슬픔을 동시에 안겨줬죠.","source_cn":"祭典、冰雪、亡灵、小公主……有快乐的回忆，也有悲伤的回忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8382A47DE4778A8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029750017:1":{"text":"아마 책갈피의 남은 부분은 <style=\"highlight\">다른 추억</style>을 찾아 떠나면 계속 밝힐 수 있겠죠?","source_cn":"想必这书签剩余的部分，随着我们继续找到<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x767C89FD2DAC9FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1029750017":{"text":"아마 책갈피의 남은 부분은 <style=\"highlight\">다른 추억</style>을 찾아 떠나면 계속 밝힐 수 있겠죠?","source_cn":"想必这书签剩余的部分，随着我们继续找到<style=highlight>其他的回忆</style>，也会继续点亮吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x767C89FD2DAC9FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1029750018:1":{"text":"그럼 서둘러서 시더 마을 쪽 일을 마무리해요!","source_cn":"那么，接下来就快些把雪松镇这边搞定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x036FCA0C1C81A7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1029750019:1":{"text":"네. 여러분이 도와주신 덕분에 이번 일은 유독 더 순조로웠어요.","source_cn":"嗯，多亏了你们帮忙，这次的推进比之前更加顺利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x974E0F02463DAAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1029750020:1":{"text":"사실, 이전까지만 해도 시더 마을이 이렇게까지 여행객들을 수용하는 데 익숙할 거라고는 생각하지 못했거든요...","source_cn":"在此之前，我完全没想到雪松镇在接待游客上会是如此驾轻就熟……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x551AF6467BCA79AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1029750021:1":{"text":"로완이 생각하지 못했다면 암살하려는 그 배후도 분명 몰랐을 거예요! 그 사람은 로완이 여기 올 거라곤 생상도 못했을 테니까요!","source_cn":"既然你没想到，那么那个幕后黑手肯定也没想到——他或者她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF29D9ED30FD14577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1029750022:1":{"text":"맞아요. 이번에 아무런 방해나 습격이 없었던 게 바로 그 증거죠.","source_cn":"是的，这次没有任何的阻碍和袭击就足以证明这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E7DF174A13D3CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen